# Copy to email.local.properties (gitignored). Do not commit a real key.
#
# Finwise does not read this file. Release builds fail closed until a human
# implements EmailAuthRepository and passes it into AiCfoController.
# Debug builds accept code 000000 and do not send mail.
#
# A real code or magic link needs a transactional mail provider
# (any inbox: Gmail, Outlook, Apple Mail, or others). Put that provider's
# API key here, then wire the sender. Do not invent a session without it.
#
# FINWISE_EMAIL_PROVIDER=
# FINWISE_EMAIL_API_KEY=
